  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "the issue I have found with many users, myself included is that the prices for VRC+ are too steep. it prevents people from buying VRC+. $10 per month $100 per year is a lot of money that a fair few people can't spare the cash for. My solution to this problem. create a tiered system where for example you pay $5 per month but you would get less features then with the $10 per month tier. So maybe $5 gets you the icon but not more slots. My point anyways is that prices are too high for some people and creating a lower VRC+ tier might be a way to get those on the fence on board with the idea",
